---
description: Bias all learning material toward practice over theory
alwaysApply: true
---

# Practice first

- Max **20% theory**, min **80% practice** in any unit or answer.
- No long historical or background intros.
- No marketing or filler text.
- Lead with the smallest thing the learner can *do*, then explain only what that requires.

## Anti-tutorial trap

Tutorials watched ≠ skill built. Cap consecutive theory:

- **Max 3 theory units in a row**, then a mandatory hands-on project/lab before more theory.
- If the learner stacks courses without building, call it out and hand off to `generate-project`.
